  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nuku&amp;apos;alofa Port Upgrade Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will upgrade the Nukualofa port, rehabilitate, renew and expand the existing infrastructure and improve the management and operations practices. The project outputs will result in the following outcome: capacity and operations of the Nukualofa Port improved. The project will be aligned with the following impact: safer, more reliable, and more affordable transport infrastructure and services in Tonga.</narrative>
  </description>
